{{Quote|This is no longer merely a search for a missing ambassador. It's become an important part of your Clone War. Remember that victory is the goal.''»<br />«''And not revenge?''»<br />«''No. Nor even rescue.|translated=1|Senior Captain Thrawn and Anakin Skywalker, in [[Meese Caulf]]|<ref name="Alliances" />}}
During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Senator]] [[Padmé Amidala Naberrie|Padmé Amidala]] received as message from one of her [[Naboo Royal Handmaidens|handmaidens]], [[Duja]]. Duja reported that [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatists]] were on [[Mokivj]] and had a [[droid]] [[Mokivj droid factory|factory]] in place. Padmé would go on to investigate, but her [[Marriage|husband]], [[Jedi Knight]] [[Anakin Skywalker]] would go in to find out what went wrong. Anakin would later meet a [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo's ship|mysterious ship]] underneath the command of [[Chiss]]<ref name="Alliances" /> [[Senior Captain]] [[Mitth'raw'nuruodo]], also known by his [[core name]] of "Thrawn." When Thrawn met Skywalker, he introduced himself as a [[commander]] instead of a Senior Captain. His [[pilot]], the [[sky-walker]] [[Che'ri]], reasoned that using the lower rank was less intimidating.<ref name="Chaos Rising" />

